WEBVTT

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:30.576
Very different.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.256
And Einstein, yeah, well,
Einstein's -- he's Einstein,

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.840
he's one of a kind, he's unique.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:39.896
But the pattern of behavior
that Einstein was demonstrating,

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.496
that's not unique at all.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:45.816
It's very common
among highly creative people,

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.496
both artists and scientists,

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.216
and I'd like to give it a name:

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.040
slow-motion multitasking.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:58.536
Slow-motion multitasking
feels like a counterintuitive idea.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.016
What I'm describing here